'' A bare zstring or wstring BY VALUE is fbc's error 28, "Expected pointer": a definition's
'' result ('as zstring', 'as wstring') and a 'byval' parameter. tiko took them and the IR
'' failed -- TKO0993 from the verifier, TKO0113 from clang.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -c tests/diagnostics/src/bare-str-result1.bas tests/diagnostics/src/bare-str-result2.bas tests/diagnostics/src/bare-str-param.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: bare-str-result1.bas(1,1): error TKO0963
'' EXPECT-OUT: bare-str-result2.bas(1,1): error TKO0963
'' EXPECT-OUT: bare-str-param.bas(1,8): error TKO0963
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0993
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0113
